  "title": "Fast and Easy Creamed Spinach",
  "description": "This somewhat healthy creamed spinach recipe from Chef John is delicious! It&#39;s a little easier and a little quicker than the traditional classic side.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
