  "ingredients": [
    "2 teaspoons olive oil",
    "2 (16 ounce) bags fresh spinach",
    "1 pinch cayenne pepper, or to taste",
    "1 pinch freshly grated nutmeg",
    "salt and freshly ground black pepper to taste",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "2 tablespoons minced shallot",
    "0.75 cup heavy whipping cream",
    "1 teaspoon freshly grated lemon zest",
    "2 tablespoons finely shredded Parmigiano-Reggiano cheese"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a large soup pot over high heat; add spinach, cover, and cook for 1 minute. Uncover and gently stir until most of the leaves are bright green and wilted, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/72TcmZdS7THfgP8ZCdWo8YEaxuQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/234938-fast-easy-creamy-spinach-step1-339-4x3-c581ffda1490412ba033e2c5bb10c09c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234938/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Quickly drain spinach in a strainer and transfer to a plate lined with 4 or 5 paper towels. Once cool enough to handle, squeeze as much liquid from the spinach as possible. Transfer spinach to a cutting board and coarsely chop.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vYPjE6iDhx_t6Oc2QsJRapBP9H0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/234938-fast-easy-creamy-spinach-step2-347-4x3-fb8f4faed0d7449ca8f2cd1c022fa657.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234938/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix cayenne pepper, nutmeg, salt, and black pepper in a small bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OgYgObnZDZIZRD81yo5todbel4I=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/234938-fast-easy-creamy-spinach-step3-341-4x3-e304f8b2ffd34be8a09f5f0fac5e4b8c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234938/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat; stir in shallot and cook until just barely golden and translucent, 3 to 4 minutes. Stir in seasoning mixture and pour in cream; increase heat to medium-high and simmer until the cream sauce reduces by about half, about 5 minutes. Stir in lemon zest.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_JVNajot-VmA6S_wnvXB5UplB7o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/234938-fast-easy-creamy-spinach-step4-343-4x3-14baebc9342e4cd2a452b196308b60b5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234938/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to low and toss spinach with cream sauce in skillet. Cook and stir until spinach is heated through and coated, about 2 minutes. Stir in Parmigiano-Reggiano cheese until thoroughly combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/OgJcPjDDJHQLgYwYJ7QXwD8-oZs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/234938-fast-easy-creamy-spinach-step5-349-4x3-3fdcb61b24404263b20b0acb0e66c75c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234938/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/faSgXwgkRjrgFfVlNqDPCnyaO4Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/234938-fast-and-easy-creamed-spinach-DDMFS-4x3-37205e4fc9c14a5e8e6ba782c3786149.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/234938/step_06.webp"
    }
  ],
